# Query 5: Executive briefing - Investor AB
# Highlights: briefing agent routing + executive summary format

Output recordings/05_briefing_investor.mp4

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "cd /home/axel-oeberg/pvk/quantera && source venv/bin/activate && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type `make query Q="Give me an executive briefing on Investor AB"`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 20s
